{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPreferences",
  "$description": "Preferences (⌘,): the application settings that follow an author between projects, as a `jx-dialog` over the kit. A section list beside one section's body, and the body is a `$switch` over four cases because the reader is looking at exactly one of them. Everything here is a projection — `settings/preferences-dialog.ts` keeps which section is showing, which theme the shell holds, what `preferences-accounts.ts` enumerates, and every decision the Keyboard sheet makes about a captured chord. **The Keyboard sheet is GENERATED**: its groups and rows come from the running registry through `commands/reference.ts`'s `shortcutReference()`, the same projection `docs/studio/interface/shortcuts.md` is built from, so a command an extension registers appears here without this document knowing it exists. **Assistant is two islands** — `managed-slot` and `creds-slot` are rendered empty and filled through `onNodeCreated` by the adapter, because the keyless Cloudflare offer and the provider-key form are surfaces of their own that three other gates also embed (studio-ui-guidelines.md §9.4, \"an island attaches through onNodeCreated\").",
  "tagName": "jx-dialog",
  "$props": {
    "headline": "Preferences",
    "confirmLabel": "",
    "cancelLabel": "Close",
    "size": "lg"
  },
  "attributes": {
    "part": "preferences"
  },
  "oncancel": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "onclose": {
    "$prototype": "Function",
    "body": [
      {
        "operator": "call",
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/state/closed"
        },
        "value": []
      }
    ]
  },
  "style": {
    "$description": "The twenty-three `.prefs-*` rules in `styles/shell.css`, keyed on `part`. Three things in them do not travel. The `sp-dialog-wrapper` card, its underlay, its focus management and its Escape are `jx-dialog`'s now, so nothing here draws a box. Eight `var(--spectrum-font-size-50 | -75 | -100, …)` reads become `--jx-text-sm` and `--jx-text-md`: a `--spectrum-*` name is declared by `<sp-theme>` and by nothing else, and a document mounted into the dialog layer is outside that element, so every one of them would silently have taken its hard-coded fallback. And `.prefs-nav-item.active` was a CLASS doing what a state should — the selected row is the one whose `aria-current` is already true, so the rule reads the accessibility tree rather than a second record of the same fact. No part below is named `field`, `label`, `body`, `error`, `text` or `actions`: the kit is light DOM, and `jx-textfield`, `jx-select` and `jx-dialog` each draw internal nodes under exactly those names inside this same tree.",
    "& [part=\"sheet\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-5)",
      "minHeight": "320px"
    },
    "& [part=\"nav\"]": {
      "$description": "A fixed 148px gutter: the four titles are known and short, and a nav that resized with its longest label would move the body under the reader as they switched sections.",
      "flex": "0 0 148px",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "borderRight": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "paddingRight": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"nav-item\"]": {
      "appearance": "none",
      "border": "0",
      "background": "transparent",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "font": "inherit",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-2) var(--jx-space-3)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)",
      "cursor": "pointer"
    },
    "& [part=\"nav-item\"]:hover": {
      "background": "var(--hover-bg)",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"nav-item\"][aria-current=\"true\"]": {
      "$description": "The selected row, drawn from the state a screen reader is already told about. `.prefs-nav-item.active` was a second spelling of `aria-current`, and two spellings of one fact is how a surface ends up announcing one row and highlighting another.",
      "background": "var(--accent-10)",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"nav-item\"]:focus-visible": {
      "outline": "var(--jx-focus-ring)",
      "outlineOffset": "-2px"
    },
    "& [part=\"section\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "maxHeight": "60vh",
      "overflowY": "auto"
    },
    "& [part=\"title\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-lg)",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"blurb\"]": {
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-2)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"empty\"]": {
      "margin": "0",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"theme-row\"], & [part=\"search-row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"theme-label\"]": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"assistant\"]": {
      "$description": "The two islands, centred in a column. `.prefs-assistant` said exactly this and lived in `styles/shell.css` under the credentials form's own heading, which is where it had drifted to: the form is embedded by three gates and this is the only one that centres it, so the rule belongs to the host rather than to the guest.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"accounts\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-2)"
    },
    "& [part=\"account\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "justifyContent": "space-between",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--radius)"
    },
    "& [part=\"account-text\"]": {
      "$description": "`min-width: 0` so a long detail sentence ellipses inside the row rather than pushing the row's own buttons off the end of it.",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "minWidth": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"account-label\"]": {
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"account-detail\"]": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"account-actions\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "flexShrink": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"keys\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)"
    },
    "& [part=\"refusal\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "flexWrap": "wrap",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"refusal-reason\"]": {
      "$description": "Named `refusal-reason` rather than `error` because `jx-textfield` draws a permanent `[part=\"error\"]` region of its own in this same light-DOM tree — the search field above this line has one — so a rule on that name would be addressing somebody else's empty paragraph first.",
      "margin": "0",
      "color": "var(--danger)",
      "lineHeight": "var(--jx-leading-md)"
    },
    "& [part=\"key-group\"]": {
      "display": "contents"
    },
    "& [part=\"scope\"]": {
      "margin": "var(--jx-space-4) 0 var(--jx-space-1)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "fontWeight": "700",
      "letterSpacing": "0.06em",
      "textTransform": "uppercase",
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"key\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "baseline",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-4)",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-1) 0"
    },
    "& [part=\"chord\"]": {
      "$description": "A fixed 96px column so the chords line up down the sheet: the answer to \"what is bound to this\" is read by scanning one column, and a chord that starts where the last one ended is not scannable.",
      "flex": "0 0 96px",
      "fontFamily": "var(--font-mono)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)",
      "color": "var(--fg)"
    },
    "& [part=\"key-title\"]": {
      "color": "var(--fg-dim)",
      "minWidth": "0"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "sheet"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "nav",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "nav",
            "aria-label": "Preferences sections"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "$prototype": "Array",
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/state/sections"
              },
              "key": {
                "$ref": "$map/item/id"
              },
              "map": {
                "tagName": "button",
                "attributes": {
                  "part": "nav-item",
                  "type": "button",
                  "data-section": "${$map.item.id}",
                  "aria-current": "${$map.item.current}"
                },
                "onclick": {
                  "$prototype": "Function",
                  "body": [
                    {
                      "operator": "call",
                      "target": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/selectSection"
                      },
                      "value": [
                        {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "textContent": "${$map.item.title}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "section",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "section"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "h3",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "title"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.sectionTitle}"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "p",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "blurb"
              },
              "textContent": "${state.sectionBlurb}"
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "section-slot",
                "role": "none"
              },
              "style": {
                "display": "contents"
              },
              "$switch": {
                "$ref": "#/state/section"
              },
              "cases": {
                "appearance": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "theme-row"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "theme-label"
                      },
                      "textContent": "Theme"
                    },
                    {
                      "tagName": "jx-action-group",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "themes"
                      },
                      "$props": {
                        "selects": "single",
                        "compact": true,
                        "label": "Theme"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "$prototype": "Array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/themes"
                          },
                          "key": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                          },
                          "map": {
                            "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "theme",
                              "data-theme": "${$map.item.value}"
                            },
                            "$props": {
                              "size": "sm",
                              "checked": {
                                "$ref": "$map/item/checked"
                              }
                            },
                            "onclick": {
                              "$prototype": "Function",
                              "body": [
                                {
                                  "operator": "call",
                                  "target": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/setTheme"
                                  },
                                  "value": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/value"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              ]
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "assistant": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "assistant"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "$description": "The keyless Cloudflare offer. An island: `ui/ai-managed-connect.ts` owns the element mounted here, and it is the same element three other credentials gates embed, so this document renders the box and nothing inside it.",
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "managed-slot",
                        "role": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "display": "contents"
                      }
                    },
                    {
                      "$description": "The provider-key form, on the same terms: `ui/ai-credentials-form.ts` owns it, and a repaint of this sheet must never rebuild three fields a reader is typing into.",
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "creds-slot",
                        "role": "none"
                      },
                      "style": {
                        "display": "contents"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "accounts": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "accounts"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "$prototype": "Array",
                      "items": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/accounts"
                      },
                      "key": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/id"
                      },
                      "map": {
                        "tagName": "div",
                        "attributes": {
                          "part": "account",
                          "data-account": "${$map.item.id}"
                        },
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "tagName": "div",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "account-text"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "account-label"
                                },
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                              },
                              {
                                "tagName": "span",
                                "attributes": {
                                  "part": "account-detail"
                                },
                                "textContent": "${$map.item.detail}"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "tagName": "div",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "account-actions"
                            },
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "$prototype": "Array",
                                "items": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/actions"
                                },
                                "key": {
                                  "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                },
                                "map": {
                                  "tagName": "jx-button",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "account-action",
                                    "data-action": "${$map.item.id}"
                                  },
                                  "$props": {
                                    "size": "sm",
                                    "variant": {
                                      "$ref": "$map/item/variant"
                                    }
                                  },
                                  "onclick": {
                                    "$prototype": "Function",
                                    "body": [
                                      {
                                        "operator": "call",
                                        "target": {
                                          "$ref": "#/state/runAccountAction"
                                        },
                                        "value": [
                                          {
                                            "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  },
                                  "children": [
                                    {
                                      "tagName": "span",
                                      "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                                    }
                                  ]
                                }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "keyboard": {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "keyboard-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "style": {
                    "display": "contents"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/keyboardState"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "none": {
                      "tagName": "p",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "empty"
                      },
                      "textContent": "${state.keyboardEmpty}"
                    },
                    "keys": {
                      "$description": "One keydown listener for the whole sheet, and `capture` is a host function in handler position so it receives the event itself: a chord is the modifier set plus the key, which no structured `$switch` on `event#/key` can spell. `stopPropagation` inside it is the load-bearing line — the app's dispatcher is a `document` listener and Preferences deliberately does not suspend the app, so without it capturing ⌘S would SAVE while the author was trying to bind it.",
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "keys"
                      },
                      "onkeydown": {
                        "$ref": "#/state/capture"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "$description": "Both toggles on this sheet are HOST-OWNED: `selected` is bound and `toggles` is off, so the button draws pressed without flipping itself — a capture also ends by itself, when the chord lands, and a button that had flipped its own state would then be lying. Neither carries `aria-pressed` as a result, and neither needs to: each announces its state through its accessible name instead, which changes with it (\"Search by keystroke\" / \"Press it now\", \"Change the shortcut for Save\" / \"Stop changing Save\").",
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "search-row"
                          },
                          "children": [
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-textfield",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "key-search"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "label": "Find a shortcut",
                                "type": "search",
                                "size": "sm",
                                "placeholder": "Find a shortcut…",
                                "value": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/keyQuery"
                                }
                              },
                              "oninput": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/setKeyQuery"
                                    },
                                    "value": [
                                      {
                                        "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            },
                            {
                              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "keystroke"
                              },
                              "$props": {
                                "size": "sm",
                                "quiet": false,
                                "selected": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/capturingSearch"
                                },
                                "label": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/keystrokeLabel"
                                }
                              },
                              "onclick": {
                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                "body": [
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/toggleKeystroke"
                                    },
                                    "value": []
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "tagName": "span",
                                  "textContent": "${state.keystrokeLabel}"
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "refusal-slot",
                            "role": "none"
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "display": "contents"
                          },
                          "$switch": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/hasRefusal"
                          },
                          "cases": {
                            "true": {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "refusal"
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "tagName": "p",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "refusal-reason",
                                    "role": "alert"
                                  },
                                  "textContent": "${state.refusal}"
                                },
                                {
                                  "tagName": "div",
                                  "attributes": {
                                    "part": "conflict-slot",
                                    "role": "none"
                                  },
                                  "style": {
                                    "display": "contents"
                                  },
                                  "$switch": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/hasConflict"
                                  },
                                  "cases": {
                                    "true": {
                                      "tagName": "jx-button",
                                      "attributes": {
                                        "part": "show-conflict"
                                      },
                                      "$props": {
                                        "size": "sm"
                                      },
                                      "onclick": {
                                        "$prototype": "Function",
                                        "body": [
                                          {
                                            "operator": "call",
                                            "target": {
                                              "$ref": "#/state/showConflict"
                                            },
                                            "value": []
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      },
                                      "children": [
                                        {
                                          "tagName": "span",
                                          "textContent": "${state.conflictLabel}"
                                        }
                                      ]
                                    }
                                  }
                                }
                              ]
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "div",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "rows-slot",
                            "role": "none"
                          },
                          "style": {
                            "display": "contents"
                          },
                          "$switch": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/rowsState"
                          },
                          "cases": {
                            "empty": {
                              "tagName": "p",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "empty"
                              },
                              "textContent": "${state.rowsEmpty}"
                            },
                            "rows": {
                              "tagName": "div",
                              "attributes": {
                                "part": "groups",
                                "role": "none"
                              },
                              "style": {
                                "display": "contents"
                              },
                              "children": [
                                {
                                  "$prototype": "Array",
                                  "items": {
                                    "$ref": "#/state/groups"
                                  },
                                  "key": {
                                    "$ref": "$map/item/scope"
                                  },
                                  "map": {
                                    "tagName": "div",
                                    "attributes": {
                                      "part": "key-group",
                                      "role": "none",
                                      "data-scope": "${$map.item.scope}"
                                    },
                                    "children": [
                                      {
                                        "tagName": "h4",
                                        "attributes": {
                                          "part": "scope"
                                        },
                                        "textContent": "${$map.item.label}"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "$prototype": "Array",
                                        "items": {
                                          "$ref": "$map/item/rows"
                                        },
                                        "key": {
                                          "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                                        },
                                        "map": {
                                          "tagName": "div",
                                          "attributes": {
                                            "part": "key",
                                            "data-command": "${$map.item.commandId}"
                                          },
                                          "children": [
                                            {
                                              "tagName": "kbd",
                                              "attributes": {
                                                "part": "chord"
                                              },
                                              "textContent": "${$map.item.chord}"
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tagName": "span",
                                              "attributes": {
                                                "part": "key-title"
                                              },
                                              "textContent": "${$map.item.title}"
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                                              "attributes": {
                                                "part": "change"
                                              },
                                              "$props": {
                                                "size": "sm",
                                                "selected": {
                                                  "$ref": "$map/item/capturing"
                                                },
                                                "label": {
                                                  "$ref": "$map/item/changeName"
                                                }
                                              },
                                              "onclick": {
                                                "$prototype": "Function",
                                                "body": [
                                                  {
                                                    "operator": "call",
                                                    "target": {
                                                      "$ref": "#/state/toggleRebind"
                                                    },
                                                    "value": [
                                                      {
                                                        "$ref": "$map/item/commandId"
                                                      }
                                                    ]
                                                  }
                                                ]
                                              },
                                              "children": [
                                                {
                                                  "tagName": "span",
                                                  "textContent": "${$map.item.changeLabel}"
                                                }
                                              ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                              "tagName": "span",
                                              "attributes": {
                                                "part": "reset-slot",
                                                "role": "none"
                                              },
                                              "style": {
                                                "display": "contents"
                                              },
                                              "$switch": {
                                                "$ref": "$map/item/overridden"
                                              },
                                              "cases": {
                                                "true": {
                                                  "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                                                  "attributes": {
                                                    "part": "reset"
                                                  },
